flowchart TD
    A[Next shape in z-order] --> B{Outside window?}
    B -- yes, not a group --> A
    B -- no --> C{Filled?}
    C -- yes --> D[Wipe covered cells]
    C -- no --> E{Kind}
    D --> E
    E -- rect, line, ellipse, straight side --> F[OR edge masks into cells]
    E -- text, stroke, arrowhead, slanted side --> G[Write solid runes]
    E -- group --> A
    F --> H{More shapes?}
    G --> H
    H -- yes --> A
    H -- no --> I{Solid at or above top edge?}
    I -- yes --> J[Solid rune and its ink]
    I -- no --> K[Rune table by mask, with edge ink]
    J --> L[Cell: rune, ink, background]
    K --> L
